<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kaa">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Programmalik ta'miynat talaplarin testlew</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 20mm 15mm;
            @bottom-right {
                content: counter(page);
                font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
                font-size: 9pt;
                color: #6b7280;
            }
            @bottom-left {
                content: "Talaplarin Testlew Portali";
                font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
                font-size: 9pt;
                color: #6b7280;
            }
        }
        
        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
            font-size: 11pt;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1f2937;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* Full bleed style title area using negative margin tricks */
        .header-banner {
            margin: -20mm -15mm 25px -15mm;
            padding: 30px 15mm;
            background: #1e3a8a;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header-banner h1 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .header-banner p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 12pt;
            color: #bfdbfe;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 14pt;
            color: #1e3a8a;
            margin-top: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-left: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            page-break-after: avoid;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .intro-box {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .intro-box p {
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Grid replacement for PDF compliance */
        .checklist-container {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-spacing: 10px;
            margin-left: -10px;
            margin-right: -10px;
        }

        .checklist-row {
            display: table-row;
        }

        .checklist-card {
            display: table-cell;
            width: 50%;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            vertical-align: top;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        .checklist-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            font-size: 12pt;
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        .checklist-card p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 10.5pt;
        }

        /* Table styles */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
        }

        td {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 9pt;
        }

        .status-error {
            background-color: #fee2e2;
            color: #b91c1c;
        }

        .status-success {
            background-color: #dcfce7;
            color: #15803d;
        }

        ul {
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header-banner">
        <h1>Programmalik Ta'miynat Talaplarin Testlew</h1>
        <p>Proekt baslanmastan aldin qa'telerdi aniqlaw ha'm sapasin ta'miyinlew sistemasi</p>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-box">
        <p><strong>Talaplarni testlew (Requirements Testing) ne ushin kerek?</strong><br>
        Bul processte bag'darlamanin' ko'rsetpeleri ha'm talaplari (SRS) kod jaziliwdan aldin analiz etiledi. Maqset – jobalastiriwdag'i qa'telerdi erte aniqlap, qarejetler ha'm waqitti tejew esaplanadi.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Tiykarg'i Tekseriw Kriteriyalari (Checklist)</h2>
    
    <div class="checklist-container">
        <div class="checklist-row">
            <div class="checklist-card">
                <h3>Aniqlik (Clarity)</h3>
                <p>Talaplar ha'mme ushin tu'snikli ha'm eki ma'nisli so'zlerden uzaq boliwi shart.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="checklist-card">
                <h3>Toliqliq (Completeness)</h3>
                <p>Barliq funksiyalar, dizimnen o'tiw ha'm qa'wipsizlik qag'iydalari toliq jazilg'an boliwi kerek.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="checklist-container">
        <div class="checklist-row">
            <div class="checklist-card">
                <h3>Izbe-izlik (Consistency)</h3>
                <p>Talaplar bir-birine qarama-qarsi kelmewi ha'm logikalik jaqtan duris boliwi shart.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="checklist-card">
                <h3>Testlewge qolayliq (Testability)</h3>
                <p>Ha'r bir talapti keleside arnawli test keysler arqali tekserip ko'riw mu'mkin boliwi kerek.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>2. Talaplar Analizinin' Misali (Traceability Matrix)</h2>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 20%;">Sayt Bo'limi</th>
                <th style="width: 35%;">Belgilengen Talap (Requirement)</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">Status</th>
                <th style="width: 30%;">Sheshimi ha'm Usinis</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Dizimnen o'tiw</strong></td>
                <td>Paydalaniwshi telefon nomeri arqali dizimnen o'tedi.</td>
                <td><span class="status-badge status-error">X Qa'te bar</span></td>
                <td>Qaysi mamleket kodlari (+998 t.b.) qabillanatu'gini aniq jaziliwi kerek.</td>
